  "ingredients": [
    "1.5 pounds fresh green beans, trimmed and snapped",
    "0.25 teaspoon garlic powder, or to taste",
    "0.25 teaspoon onion powder, or to taste",
    "salt and pepper to taste",
    "3 tablespoons olive oil"
  ],
  "steps": [
    {
      "text": "Gather ingredients.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/SGWegP_JZupgDjXqqqOlVNZQkr0=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/23724-PanFriedGreenBeans-MFS-Step1-0165-a8573928fed14d4a83b03894eb54c09f.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/23724/step_01.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Combine green beans, garlic powder, onion powder, salt, and pepper in a stainless steel pot over medium-high heat. Cook, covered, until beans begin to sweat. Remove the lid and stir occasionally until beans are tender.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/OX6tiEFqGtEuT0kQRuOpWNdxq8I=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/23724-PanFriedGreenBeans-MFS-Step2-0206-775fcf411f6349268376d8643ab6cbd9.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/23724/step_02.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "When beans and spices begin to char on the bottom of the pan, stir in olive oil and turn off heat. Cover and let stand a few minutes.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/bvaV9iR6tZXN-iFWAHf0aybrwdw=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/23724-PanFriedGreenBeans-MFS-Step3-0208-d1f9cbc14ed14950a57a49e1c4b0b21e.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/23724/step_03.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Scrape the bottom of the pan to incorporate charred spices. Beans should have a dark, caramel color, but not black.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/KbmHHR_uBOHXLYZb42CvKikCdF4=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/23724-PanFriedGreenBeans-MFS-Step4-0209-729af0360d7749068f6bfc0d31fed015.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/23724/step_04.webp"
    }
  ],
